<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net buyers of S.African bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of S.African bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				     Week to April 18  Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		   6,597.87	   104,087.77</p>
<p>    - sales			 5,812.81	    96,322.01</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)     785.06	     7,765.76</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
